WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.571 --> 00:00:03.335
- And just because somebody
else can't see your vision

00:00:03.335 --> 00:00:06.344
doesn't mean that it's not
a powerful vision for you.

00:00:06.344 --> 00:00:07.686
But if you don't love what you're doing,

00:00:07.686 --> 00:00:08.783
run for your life.

00:00:08.783 --> 00:00:12.950
We need to stop whining
about what isn't happening,

00:00:14.068 --> 00:00:15.875
what we don't have, what we can't do,

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:17.600
what somebody didn't do.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.918
The truth will cut through all the drama,

00:00:19.918 --> 00:00:22.440
all the misunderstanding, all the hurt,

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.413
all the pain, all the memories.

00:00:24.413 --> 00:00:26.787
I got something for you:

00:00:26.787 --> 00:00:28.024
refuse to fail!

00:00:28.024 --> 00:00:31.544
Like, being wrong is almost
a fatal disease or something,

00:00:31.544 --> 00:00:33.619
like it'll drop and die on the spot

00:00:33.619 --> 00:00:35.332
if we have to say "I was wrong".

00:00:35.332 --> 00:00:36.415
Be authentic.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:38.733
Be authentic.

00:00:39.866 --> 00:00:41.159
My car got a name.

00:00:41.159 --> 00:00:44.164
I say "Gracie, how you're
doing this morning?

00:00:44.164 --> 00:00:45.637
"Come on, we going traveling".

00:00:45.637 --> 00:00:50.012
Also, be really clear
about what it is you want.

00:00:50.012 --> 00:00:51.427
Talk to yourself about it.

00:00:51.427 --> 00:00:52.927
Clarity is a gift,

00:00:53.842 --> 00:00:57.986
and it grows and develops
through practice.

00:00:57.986 --> 00:01:00.118
- She's an American inspirational speaker,

00:01:00.118 --> 00:01:04.884
author, life coach, lawyer
and television personality.

00:01:04.884 --> 00:01:06.210
- She's known for her books

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.975
and appearances on the Oprah Winfrey Show.

00:01:08.975 --> 00:01:10.125
- She's considered one of the 100

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:13.298
most spiritually influential
living people in the world.

00:01:13.298 --> 00:01:15.389
- She's Iyanla Vanzant,

00:01:15.389 --> 00:01:18.889
and here are her top 10 rules for success.

00:01:21.967 --> 00:01:24.988
- Three things I want you to
do to nurture your vision.

00:01:24.988 --> 00:01:27.621
I want you to affirm it every day.

00:01:27.621 --> 00:01:29.026
Affirm it every day.

00:01:29.026 --> 00:01:33.863
And don't affirm as, "I'm
trying", "I wish", "I want to".

00:01:33.863 --> 00:01:34.696
"I am"!

00:01:34.696 --> 00:01:36.457
Let me hear you say "I am".

00:01:36.457 --> 00:01:37.864
- I am!
- I am!

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:39.092
- I am!
- I am!

00:01:39.092 --> 00:01:40.596
- I am!
- I am!

00:01:40.596 --> 00:01:42.224
- I am!
- I am!

00:01:42.224 --> 00:01:44.092
- I am!
- I am!

00:01:44.092 --> 00:01:46.145
- I am!
- Every single day,

00:01:46.145 --> 00:01:50.206
"I am" is the creative
force of the universe!

00:01:50.206 --> 00:01:54.039
Whatever you attach "I
am" to you will become.

00:01:54.921 --> 00:01:58.289
You know, people say "I'm broke".

00:01:58.289 --> 00:02:01.289
(audience laughing)

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:03.683
Or "I'm single".

00:02:04.946 --> 00:02:06.338
No.

00:02:06.338 --> 00:02:08.955
"I'm waiting for my ideal
mate to present himself to me

00:02:08.955 --> 00:02:11.501
"in a way that I recognize".

00:02:11.501 --> 00:02:15.584
(audience cheering and laughing)

00:02:16.584 --> 00:02:19.084
Whatever you attach "I am" to.

00:02:20.627 --> 00:02:22.210
"I'm confused". No.

00:02:23.771 --> 00:02:26.938
"I'm awaiting clarity in this moment".

00:02:28.891 --> 00:02:31.568
So affirm your vision every day.

00:02:31.568 --> 00:02:34.347
And just because somebody
else can't see your vision

00:02:34.347 --> 00:02:37.603
doesn't mean that it's not
a powerful vision for you.

00:02:37.603 --> 00:02:39.665
Here's another key for you:

00:02:39.665 --> 00:02:43.832
never judge your clarity on
how other people respond.

00:02:47.304 --> 00:02:48.345
Did you hear me?

00:02:48.345 --> 00:02:50.124
They will say, "What you doing? You crazy?

00:02:50.124 --> 00:02:51.897
"Why you're doing that? You can't do that!

00:02:51.897 --> 00:02:54.201
"Who told you you can do that?

00:02:54.201 --> 00:02:55.338
"Who do you think you are?"

00:02:55.338 --> 00:02:58.137
I love that one. "Who
do you think you are?"

00:02:58.137 --> 00:02:59.727
"Me".

00:02:59.727 --> 00:03:03.629
Affirm your vision. Clarify your vision.

00:03:03.629 --> 00:03:07.638
Know what you're doing,
why you're doing it

00:03:07.638 --> 00:03:09.004
and how you're doing it.

00:03:09.004 --> 00:03:11.024
Day by day, moment by moment.

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:15.500
And sometime the how only shows
up on a need-to-know basis.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:19.204
Don't wait for the how until
you stop pursuing your vision,

00:03:19.204 --> 00:03:20.339
you understand?

00:03:20.339 --> 00:03:21.250
Don't wait for the how.

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:23.861
Sometimes you just have to walk blindly,

00:03:23.861 --> 00:03:26.219
but if you just do your vision,

00:03:26.219 --> 00:03:30.386
every single day, putting one
foot in front of the other,

00:03:32.307 --> 00:03:35.922
committed to your desires, being obedient,

00:03:35.922 --> 00:03:38.571
walking through your fears,

00:03:38.571 --> 00:03:40.989
the vision will unfold much grander

00:03:40.989 --> 00:03:45.458
than you could have ever
even imagined or asked for.

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:47.683
So, this is what I say.

00:03:47.683 --> 00:03:50.640
To support your vision,
instead of begging for it,

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:53.448
pleading for it, pray "Oh, God, please.

00:03:53.448 --> 00:03:55.099
"Please, God. Please.

00:03:55.099 --> 00:03:58.266
"Oh, God, please. Please, God, please.

00:03:59.173 --> 00:04:01.173
"Oh, Allelu, allelu ..."

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:06.243
Be still.

00:04:08.892 --> 00:04:11.642
Let your daily spiritual practice

00:04:12.704 --> 00:04:15.537
be one of stillness and listening.

00:04:17.414 --> 00:04:19.581
Listen for the instruction

00:04:20.866 --> 00:04:24.670
instead of begging for the direction.

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:26.087
Listen. Be still.

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:31.901
I don't care what it is that
you're doing in this world.

00:04:31.901 --> 00:04:34.877
I know many of you're involved
in the government here,

00:04:34.877 --> 00:04:37.454
and we have so many elected officials

00:04:37.454 --> 00:04:41.621
and people who are serving
the world in so many ways,

00:04:42.587 --> 00:04:46.941
but if you don't love what
you're doing, run for your life.

00:04:46.941 --> 00:04:48.441
Run for your life.

00:04:50.874 --> 00:04:52.729
(audience applauding)

00:04:52.729 --> 00:04:55.227
If find that in three days out of the five

00:04:55.227 --> 00:04:58.756
you do in your work you
complain more than you bless,

00:04:58.756 --> 00:05:00.256
run for your life.

00:05:02.656 --> 00:05:05.250
If you're continually looking
at what your don't have,

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:08.099
what people aren't doing,
as opposed to looking

00:05:08.099 --> 00:05:10.243
how blessed you are in that position,

00:05:10.243 --> 00:05:11.802
run for your life.

00:05:11.802 --> 00:05:15.167
You got cooties and you
need to run for your life.

00:05:15.167 --> 00:05:17.181
So, I have this thing
that I've been promoting

00:05:17.181 --> 00:05:19.764
called "No whining Wednesdays".

00:05:21.215 --> 00:05:25.382
Wednesday you cannot whine,
complain or criticize.

00:05:27.634 --> 00:05:30.328
And people are like,
"Well, what is whining?"

00:05:30.328 --> 00:05:34.216
Whatever you think it is, don't do it.

00:05:34.216 --> 00:05:38.383
And every time you do it you
have to put a quarter in a jar.

00:05:39.351 --> 00:05:42.453
If you whine about anything,
"I can't", "I'm kind of ...",

00:05:42.453 --> 00:05:44.613
"Why to me?", "Why don't you ...?",

00:05:44.613 --> 00:05:46.113
"Why haven't ...?"

00:05:47.603 --> 00:05:50.138
Every one of that will cost you a quarter.

00:05:50.138 --> 00:05:51.708
Or complaining, "Why don't you ...?",

00:05:51.708 --> 00:05:53.521
"Why do you always ...?",
"How come you ...?",

00:05:53.521 --> 00:05:56.084
"I have always ...", "They never ..."

00:05:56.084 --> 00:05:57.683
Cost you a quarter.

00:05:57.683 --> 00:06:00.492
Then last week I had
people sent me pictures

00:06:00.492 --> 00:06:02.754
of their jars of quarters.

00:06:02.754 --> 00:06:05.816
Oh, my God. (laughs)

00:06:05.816 --> 00:06:09.518
But what they said to me
also was "this was wonderful

00:06:09.518 --> 00:06:12.513
"because I was never, ever aware

00:06:12.513 --> 00:06:17.070
"of how much whining and
complaining and criticizing I do".

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:20.815
Now I've got mothers doing
it with their children.

00:06:20.815 --> 00:06:24.217
So Wednesday is "No whining Wednesday".

00:06:24.217 --> 00:06:26.228
We need to practice that.

00:06:26.228 --> 00:06:30.395
We need to stop whining
about what isn't happening,

00:06:31.408 --> 00:06:33.219
what we don't have, what we can't do,

00:06:33.219 --> 00:06:35.888
what somebody didn't do.

00:06:35.888 --> 00:06:39.297
We got to get it cleaned in 2014.

00:06:39.297 --> 00:06:42.880
No whining, no complaining,
no criticizing.

00:06:45.072 --> 00:06:46.410
Keep it simple.

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:48.971
The truth will cut through all the drama,

00:06:48.971 --> 00:06:51.433
all the misunderstanding, all the hurt,

00:06:51.433 --> 00:06:53.336
all the pain, all the memories.

00:06:53.336 --> 00:06:54.586
Keep it simple.

00:06:56.041 --> 00:06:59.037
I don't care how long you've
been with Fifi or Bubu,

00:06:59.037 --> 00:07:01.670
if they leave you is not because
something's wrong with you,

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:03.296
they ain't the one for you!

00:07:03.296 --> 00:07:04.580
Keep it simple.

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:06.536
You got laid off from your job?

00:07:06.536 --> 00:07:09.324
There's another divine
opportunity waiting for you to --

00:07:09.324 --> 00:07:10.292
Keep it simple.

00:07:10.292 --> 00:07:12.314
You lost your house? Well,
in your father's house

00:07:12.314 --> 00:07:14.481
there are many men, gents.

00:07:14.481 --> 00:07:16.898
Just hang around long enough.

00:07:18.459 --> 00:07:19.709
Keep it simple.

00:07:23.019 --> 00:07:25.212
The path to greatness:

00:07:25.212 --> 00:07:26.045
order,

00:07:27.588 --> 00:07:28.421
vision,

00:07:29.805 --> 00:07:30.638
trust,

00:07:32.526 --> 00:07:33.359
faith,

00:07:36.155 --> 00:07:38.355
a good piece of chocolate,

00:07:38.355 --> 00:07:40.880
(audience laughing)
and simplicity.

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:42.921
I've got something for you:

00:07:42.921 --> 00:07:44.171
refuse to fail!

00:07:46.032 --> 00:07:49.889
(audience applauding)
Refuse!

00:07:49.889 --> 00:07:51.556
Just refuse to fail!

00:07:53.344 --> 00:07:55.457
And if what you're doing looks like

00:07:55.457 --> 00:08:00.161
it's going to move you toward
failure, do something else.

00:08:00.161 --> 00:08:02.411
Look at me. Refuse to fail.

00:08:03.405 --> 00:08:04.822
I refuse to fail.

00:08:06.169 --> 00:08:08.347
Now, that may mean that
I have to walk barefoot,

00:08:08.347 --> 00:08:10.188
it may mean that I have
to sleep in a park,

00:08:10.188 --> 00:08:12.189
it may mean that I have to ask for help,

00:08:12.189 --> 00:08:14.454
it may mean that I have
to give something up,

00:08:14.454 --> 00:08:16.105
it may mean that I have to stop --

00:08:16.105 --> 00:08:17.855
But I refuse to fail.

00:08:19.286 --> 00:08:21.524
We like to be right. Yeah.

00:08:21.524 --> 00:08:24.931
Like being wrong is almost a
fatal disease or something,

00:08:24.931 --> 00:08:27.080
like it'll drop and die on the spot

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:30.491
if we have to say "I was wrong", you know?

00:08:30.491 --> 00:08:34.408
So, if we look around
and anybody challenges us

00:08:35.362 --> 00:08:36.694
we'll give up what we believe.

00:08:36.694 --> 00:08:39.275
So, here is one of the
things that I learned

00:08:39.275 --> 00:08:41.192
on my journey to peace.

00:08:42.311 --> 00:08:44.644
I don't need your agreement.

00:08:46.069 --> 00:08:48.402
I'm asking for your support.

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:51.950
(audience applauding)
I don't need your agreement.

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:56.682
Not going to get people to
agree with what you know in here

00:08:56.682 --> 00:09:00.265
'cause they don't know
that thing in there.

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:05.607
Never judge your clarity based
on somebody else's response.

00:09:08.118 --> 00:09:09.953
When you're clear, you're clear.

00:09:09.953 --> 00:09:11.486
Hold to your clarity.

00:09:11.486 --> 00:09:14.859
And if people look like they
judge you, close your eyes.

00:09:14.859 --> 00:09:15.942
Be authentic.

00:09:16.993 --> 00:09:18.076
Be authentic.

00:09:21.386 --> 00:09:25.176
Many people don't even
know what that means.

00:09:25.176 --> 00:09:28.974
It means that you're
clear about who you are,

00:09:28.974 --> 00:09:30.866
you're clear about your purpose,

00:09:30.866 --> 00:09:32.634
your protocols and your plans,

00:09:32.634 --> 00:09:34.753
you're clear about what you're up to,

00:09:34.753 --> 00:09:38.856
and you speak the truth
of that all the time.

00:09:38.856 --> 00:09:39.878
Be authentic.

00:09:39.878 --> 00:09:41.589
It means you're in integrity.

00:09:41.589 --> 00:09:44.136
That what you think, what you say,

00:09:44.136 --> 00:09:47.649
what you feel and what you do all matter.

00:09:47.649 --> 00:09:51.409
Now, I know that's hard in Washington

00:09:51.409 --> 00:09:55.037
'cause there's just some
truths you can't tell out here,

00:09:55.037 --> 00:09:57.813
but we want to do the best that we can.

00:09:57.813 --> 00:10:00.646
And when you can't, pray about it.

00:10:01.844 --> 00:10:02.996
But be authentic.

00:10:02.996 --> 00:10:07.880
So many of us don't allow
people to know who we are.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:11.089
As I travel around this
country I meet people

00:10:11.089 --> 00:10:15.172
all over the country who
are suffering in silence

00:10:17.249 --> 00:10:21.468
because they're not authentic
about what they need,

00:10:21.468 --> 00:10:24.232
what they want, what they're doing,

00:10:24.232 --> 00:10:26.058
what they're experiencing.

00:10:26.058 --> 00:10:28.225
Let's clean up our mouths,

00:10:29.832 --> 00:10:33.582
how we say what we say,
and who we say it to.

00:10:35.849 --> 00:10:39.766
Do you know you can talk
yourself into trouble?

00:10:41.234 --> 00:10:45.401
A lot easier that you can
talk yourself out of it.

00:10:46.375 --> 00:10:50.542
But if you become mindful
about what you're speaking

00:10:52.176 --> 00:10:54.970
it'll be a lot easier to
handle some of the things

00:10:54.970 --> 00:10:58.738
that come up in your life with speaking.

00:10:58.738 --> 00:11:03.089
Years and years and years
ago I learned a secret.

00:11:03.089 --> 00:11:06.339
I used to open my pocketable, my purse,

00:11:07.295 --> 00:11:09.129
I'd get right down over it and I'd say,

00:11:09.129 --> 00:11:12.884
"Fill yourself with divine
substance right now!"

00:11:12.884 --> 00:11:16.250
(audience laughing)

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:18.036
"Oh, you, look at all that abundance

00:11:18.036 --> 00:11:19.623
"just pouring down right at --

00:11:19.623 --> 00:11:22.206
"Oh!" (laughs)

00:11:25.068 --> 00:11:28.249
I named everything and
I speak to everything.

00:11:28.249 --> 00:11:29.559
My car got a name.

00:11:29.559 --> 00:11:32.586
I say, "Gracie, how
you're doing this morning?

00:11:32.586 --> 00:11:34.659
"Come on, we're going traveling".

00:11:34.659 --> 00:11:38.576
My house got a name,
Villanova, the big vision.

00:11:39.721 --> 00:11:42.347
I'm mindful of my mouth,

00:11:42.347 --> 00:11:45.543
because I know that what
comes out of my mouth

00:11:45.543 --> 00:11:47.561
must be creative.

00:11:47.561 --> 00:11:50.259
Everything begins with a word.

00:11:50.259 --> 00:11:53.746
So, we even want to stop speaking about

00:11:53.746 --> 00:11:55.907
how horrible our children are doing,

00:11:55.907 --> 00:11:59.489
or how bad people are doing,
or how bad things are.

00:11:59.489 --> 00:12:03.952
Well, here's an affirmation,
"Oh, my, I can't hardly wait

00:12:03.952 --> 00:12:07.136
"to see the good that's
going to come out of this",

00:12:07.136 --> 00:12:08.909
no matter what it is,

00:12:08.909 --> 00:12:13.628
as opposed to you using our
power to continue to affirm

00:12:13.628 --> 00:12:16.118
what's wrong, what's
broke, what ain't working,

00:12:16.118 --> 00:12:18.626
what's not happening, how horrible it is.

00:12:18.626 --> 00:12:21.043
Let's speak life into things.

00:12:21.963 --> 00:12:25.129
Let's speak life into our children.

00:12:25.129 --> 00:12:29.223
Let's speak life into our
families, into our relationships.

00:12:29.223 --> 00:12:32.616
I can't tell you the number of
people who write me and say,

00:12:32.616 --> 00:12:35.842
"I need you to help me
with my crazy family".

00:12:35.842 --> 00:12:38.034
Well, they're your family.

00:12:38.034 --> 00:12:41.325
(audience laughing)
(laughs)

00:12:41.325 --> 00:12:43.922
I don't even know that kind
of crazy you got over there.

00:12:43.922 --> 00:12:45.429
This is just what I'd be thinking

00:12:45.429 --> 00:12:46.869
and then I'd bless my head

00:12:46.869 --> 00:12:49.574
so that that thought will go away.

00:12:49.574 --> 00:12:51.073
But, what if we started saying,

00:12:51.073 --> 00:12:54.915
"Well, I know it looks
like Bubu, my cousin,

00:12:54.915 --> 00:12:56.747
"is having difficulty right now,

00:12:56.747 --> 00:12:59.152
"but I see a brighter day for you"?

00:12:59.152 --> 00:13:01.921
It's what Emmet Fox called "Golden key",

00:13:01.921 --> 00:13:05.307
when you key something up
with the radiant richness

00:13:05.307 --> 00:13:07.457
of what you wanted to be as opposed

00:13:07.457 --> 00:13:12.416
to affirming it as it is
right now, as it is right now.

00:13:12.416 --> 00:13:15.261
So we want to clean up our mouths

00:13:15.261 --> 00:13:17.006
of what we say about each other.

00:13:17.006 --> 00:13:20.006
Imagine that you have 24 hours a day

00:13:20.842 --> 00:13:22.893
for how many years.

00:13:22.893 --> 00:13:26.043
How much of that time do
you give just for you,

00:13:26.043 --> 00:13:28.838
where you just sit and
be present with you,

00:13:28.838 --> 00:13:31.197
self care and self nurturing?

00:13:31.197 --> 00:13:35.717
Also, being really clear
about what it is you want.

00:13:35.717 --> 00:13:37.226
Talk to yourself about it.

00:13:37.226 --> 00:13:39.486
Talk to somebody you care about about it.

00:13:39.486 --> 00:13:42.658
Hear your own voice and
honor your own feeling,

00:13:42.658 --> 00:13:44.296
and be good to you.

00:13:44.296 --> 00:13:45.129
Be clear

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:50.676
about who you are and what you're up to

00:13:50.676 --> 00:13:53.587
at any given point in time.

00:13:53.587 --> 00:13:57.754
Be clear about what matters
to you, what you value,

00:13:59.714 --> 00:14:03.270
what you will do, what you
won't do, what you can do

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:04.785
and what you can't do.

00:14:04.785 --> 00:14:07.923
Be clear. Clarity is a gift,

00:14:07.923 --> 00:14:11.754
and it grows and develops
through practice.

00:14:11.754 --> 00:14:15.003
Be clear. Be clear about who you are.

00:14:15.003 --> 00:14:18.219
Many, many years ago, when I
first started doing this work

00:14:18.219 --> 00:14:21.024
and I was writing, I
wrote a little purple book

00:14:21.024 --> 00:14:23.023
called "Acts of Faith",

00:14:23.023 --> 00:14:25.672
and the book had a life all of its own.

00:14:25.672 --> 00:14:27.574
And I was running all over speaking

00:14:27.574 --> 00:14:30.208
and talking about "Acts
of Faith" and stuff,

00:14:30.208 --> 00:14:32.828
and making money on the book,

00:14:32.828 --> 00:14:35.745
speaking for $50 and $300 and $200.

00:14:36.786 --> 00:14:40.953
I had to get clear, 'cause
I had $500 worth of clothes.

00:14:43.251 --> 00:14:45.084
It was not profitable.

00:14:46.217 --> 00:14:47.872
But I had to get clear.

00:14:47.872 --> 00:14:49.985
And Dennis Kimbro said this to me

00:14:49.985 --> 00:14:53.099
right in the halls of the
old convention center.

00:14:53.099 --> 00:14:56.623
He said, "Iyanla, be
clear about what you are.

00:14:56.623 --> 00:15:00.790
"Are you a writer who speaks
or a speaker who writes?"

00:15:01.788 --> 00:15:04.743
Sometimes, when we do multiple things,

00:15:04.743 --> 00:15:06.226
we throw them all together

00:15:06.226 --> 00:15:09.814
and we practice each and we master none.

00:15:09.814 --> 00:15:12.064
Be clear about who you are,

00:15:13.269 --> 00:15:15.382
about what you do, what you're up to,

00:15:15.382 --> 00:15:19.549
what is your primary cause
of action and call to action.

00:15:20.581 --> 00:15:22.526
You got to be clear.

00:15:22.526 --> 00:15:25.271
And listening to what
Dennis Kimbro said to me,

00:15:25.271 --> 00:15:29.648
was I a speaker who writes
or a writer who speaks,

00:15:29.648 --> 00:15:32.648
I said, "Well, I ain't none of that.

00:15:33.954 --> 00:15:38.590
"That's something that I do,
but that's not who I be".

00:15:38.590 --> 00:15:39.507
Who you be?

00:15:40.405 --> 00:15:44.322
You've got to get clear about who you be,

00:15:44.322 --> 00:15:46.925
because being is an internal state,

00:15:46.925 --> 00:15:49.979
it's not about doing,
it's what drives you,

00:15:49.979 --> 00:15:52.079
what elevates you, what you will do

00:15:52.079 --> 00:15:55.759
every single day of your life
for the rest of your life

00:15:55.759 --> 00:15:57.421
whether you got paid or not.

00:15:57.421 --> 00:15:59.035
That's who you be.

00:15:59.035 --> 00:16:01.726
What matters to you, that's who you be.

00:16:01.726 --> 00:16:05.102
What you value, that's who you be.

00:16:05.102 --> 00:16:09.413
And so many of us are clear
about what we have to do

00:16:09.413 --> 00:16:13.197
but not clear about who
we be as we're doing it,

00:16:13.197 --> 00:16:14.771
'cause some of us want to serve people,

00:16:14.771 --> 00:16:18.438
and we end on a wet cap
on any given Sunday.

00:16:19.436 --> 00:16:21.993
Get clear about who you be.

00:16:21.993 --> 00:16:23.443
- Thank you so much for watching.

00:16:23.443 --> 00:16:26.074
- We made this video
because Jessica Salter

00:16:26.074 --> 00:16:27.062
asked us to.

00:16:27.062 --> 00:16:29.095
If there's anyone that you
would like us to feature

00:16:29.095 --> 00:16:30.750
please leave a comment below.

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:32.394
- I'd also love to know
which of the 10 rules

00:16:32.394 --> 00:16:33.427
hit you the hardest,

00:16:33.427 --> 00:16:35.866
had the greatest impact
on your life and why.

00:16:35.866 --> 00:16:38.240
Leave in the comments and
we'll join the discussion.

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:40.012
Thank you so much for watching,

00:16:40.012 --> 00:16:42.033
and continue to believe.

00:16:42.033 --> 00:16:44.450
And we'll see you soon.
- Bye.

